      "subject": "Campus Recruitment Drive 2026 — Schedule & Shortlist Confirmation",
      "snippet": "Dear Placement Officer, We have reviewed the initial candidate pool from Lourdes Mount College of Science & Technology for the Specialist Programmer and Digital Specialist Engineer roles...",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b;\">\n        <p>Dear Placement Officer,</p>\n        <p>We are pleased to confirm that <strong>Infosys Technologies</strong> will conduct on-campus / hybrid evaluations for the <strong>2026 Graduating Batch</strong> on <strong>October 15, 2026</strong>.</p>\n        <p>The selection process comprises:</p>\n        <ol style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">\n          <li>Online Coding Assessment (90 mins - DSA & Logic)</li>\n          <li>Technical Interview (Virtual / In-person)</li>\n          <li>HR Discussion & Document Verification</li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>Please find attached the detailed eligibility criteria, package structures (₹9.5 LPA for SP, ₹6.5 LPA for DSE), and student registration portal instructions.</p>\n        <p>Kindly verify that all students update their CGPA and active backlogs prior to the screening deadline.</p>\n        <br/>\n        <p>Warm regards,<br/><strong>Rajesh Kumar</strong><br/>Head of Campus Talent Acquisition<br/>Infosys Limited, Bangalore</p>\n      </div>",
      "bodyText": "Dear Placement Officer,\n\nWe are pleased to confirm that Infosys Technologies will conduct on-campus evaluations on October 15, 2026...",
